description	"Brianna, The Handmaiden

A mobile Jedi Guardian who places her strengths in martial abilities combined with force techniques. 

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- Faster Movement Speed
-- 35% faster RoF
- Staff (Staff/Purple)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- BP Free Jumps
-- Extra Saber Training (2)
- Echani Battle Stimulant (Stimpack)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Sense (1)
- Protect (1) ^3[CS4]
- Dark Rage (3)
- Force Speed (2)

^8Attributes:
- Enhanced Conditioning (Env Protect 1)
- Strong Against Physical 
- Dash (2)
- Dexterity (3)/Knockdown Roll
- Dodge (3)
- Heal capped at 35hp
- Fury (3)
- Flipkick (3)
- Force Block(2)/Focus(2)"
